# 🩺 MedScan: AI-Powered Medical Report Analyzer

M**MedScan** is a full-stack web application that helps users understand their medical reports by using **OCR + AI**. It extracts data from lab reports, identifies abnormal values, explains medical terms in simple language, and gives personalized diet & lifestyle suggestions.

![MedScan Dashboard](dashboard.png)

---

## 🚀 Key Features

- **OCR Integration**: Extracts text from medical report images using Tesseract.js
- **AI Analysis**: Uses **Google Gemini** to analyze reports and generate structured insights
- **Smart Insights**: Shows test values vs normal ranges with color-coded status
- **Personalized Recommendations**: Diet, lifestyle, and precautions based on actual report
- **History Management**: View and search all previous reports
- **AI Health Assistant**: Chatbot to answer questions about reports

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

| Layer        | Technology                          |
|-------------|-------------------------------------|
| Frontend    | React + Vite + Tailwind CSS         |
| Backend     | Node.js + Express                   |
| Database    | MongoDB                             |
| OCR         | Tesseract.js                        |
| AI          | Google Gemini 1.5 Flash             |
| File Upload | Multer                              |

