## ⚙️ Quick Start

1. **Clone the repository**:
   ```bash
   git clone [https://github.com/KanishkaGarg04/MedScan.git](https://github.com/KanishkaGarg04/MedScan.git)
   cd MedScan
Setup:

Create a .env file in the backend/ directory.

Add your MONGO_URI and GEMINI_API_KEY.

Install & Run:

```bash
# Backend
cd backend
npm install
npm start

# Frontend (new terminal)
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev


